=== checkpoint schema ===
valid                                                -> VALID
absent file                                          -> ARTIFACT_MISSING
empty file                                           -> ARTIFACT_UNPARSEABLE
not json                                             -> ARTIFACT_UNPARSEABLE
truncated json                                       -> ARTIFACT_UNPARSEABLE
a JSON array, not an object                          -> ARTIFACT_UNPARSEABLE
a bare JSON string                                   -> ARTIFACT_UNPARSEABLE
JSON null                                            -> ARTIFACT_UNPARSEABLE
wrong schema id                                      -> ARTIFACT_SCHEMA_MISMATCH
member present but null                              -> ARTIFACT_MEMBER_MISSING
member present but EMPTY []                          -> VALID
member present but empty ""                          -> VALID
continuation body under checkpoint members           -> VALID

=== continuation schema (extra members) ===
valid continuation                                   -> VALID
checkpoint body offered as a continuation            -> ARTIFACT_SCHEMA_MISMATCH
continuation missing in_flight                       -> ARTIFACT_MEMBER_MISSING

NOTE: a shape-valid artifact whose every member is empty is VALID (disclosed
      in the record as 'validated for shape, not for usefulness').

=== no member value ever reaches the identity that goes to the result ===
  identity: {"path":"/tmp/rev1.5b/art/c.json","sha256":"sha256:7c8eaac3fc0b82bc46ac7851dbb1ce0cd9a26a65349e8422f0ad017ce5a8f172"}
  no leak of [gate]
  no leak of [AC-1]
