  sha matches the file: yes

=== the freshness (ARTIFACT_STALE) identity check, transcribed from dispatch.sh ===
1488:            && "$CONTINUATION_BEFORE" == "$(sha256_of "$CONTINUATION_FILE")" ]]; then
1489-        verdict="ARTIFACT_STALE"
1490-      fi
1491-    fi
  before=<none>   after=aaa      in=VALID    -> VALID
  before=aaa      after=aaa      in=VALID    -> ARTIFACT_STALE
  before=aaa      after=bbb      in=VALID    -> VALID
  before=aaa      after=aaa      in=ARTIFACT_MISSING -> ARTIFACT_MISSING
  (row 2 is the refusal: a byte-identical artifact after the run was not written by this worker)

