  1244:  [[ -f "$CONTINUATION_FILE" ]] && CONTINUATION_BEFORE="$(sha256_of "$CONTINUATION_FILE")"
  1352:      rm -f "$result_file"
  1352:      rm -f "$result_file"
  1241:  CHECKPOINT_FILE="${STORY}.checkpoint.json"
  1243:  CONTINUATION_BEFORE="" CHECKPOINT_BEFORE=""
  1244:  [[ -f "$CONTINUATION_FILE" ]] && CONTINUATION_BEFORE="$(sha256_of "$CONTINUATION_FILE")"
  (the result artifact IS removed pre-launch; the checkpoint is neither removed
   nor sha-captured, so a checkpoint left by an EARLIER cycle is reported as this
   cycle's checkpoint_artifact identity.)
